flowchart TD
    %% Swimlane Activity Diagram
    Start([● Start: Family Searches Caregiver]) --> Search[Enter Search Criteria: Skills, Max Rate, Verified Badge]
    Search --> FilterQuery[CaregiverRepository queries Firestore & applies filters]
    FilterQuery --> ViewProfile[Family views Caregiver Profile, Hourly Rate & Bio]
    ViewProfile --> BookAction[Family selects Visit Date, Time & Enters Service Notes]
    BookAction --> CreateBooking[Create Booking document in Firestore with Status: PENDING]
    
    CreateBooking --> CaregiverNotify[Caregiver receives real-time snapshot & FCM alert]
    CaregiverNotify --> DecisionAccept{Caregiver accepts request?}

    DecisionAccept -- No (Decline) --> SetReject[Update Booking status: REJECTED]
    SetReject --> NotifyFamilyReject[Family receives Rejection notification]
    NotifyFamilyReject --> EndDecline([● Session Terminated])

    DecisionAccept -- Yes (Accept) --> SetAccept[Update Booking status: ACCEPTED]
    SetAccept --> ScheduledWait[Wait until Scheduled Visit Date & Time]
    
    ScheduledWait --> CaregiverArrive[Caregiver arrives at Family residence]
    CaregiverArrive --> CheckInTap[Caregiver taps 'Check-In' on BookingDetailActivity]
    CheckInTap --> RecordCheckIn[Capture System.currentTimeMillis and set Status: IN_PROGRESS]
    
    RecordCheckIn --> DeliverCare[Caregiver delivers eldercare / healthcare service]
    DeliverCare --> FinishService[Care session completed]
    
    FinishService --> CheckOutTap[Caregiver taps 'Check-Out' on BookingDetailActivity]
    CheckOutTap --> CaptureCheckOut[Capture System.currentTimeMillis]
    
    CaptureCheckOut --> FetchRate[Fetch Caregiver hourly rate from profile]
    FetchRate --> CalcUseCase[Invoke BillCalculationUseCase.calculate]
    
    subgraph BillCalcSubprocess ["Automated Bill Calculation Logic"]
        CalcDuration["duration = checkOutTimestamp - checkInTimestamp"]
        CalcHours["loggedHours = round(duration / 3600000, 2 decimals)"]
        CalcSubtotal["subtotal = loggedHours * hourlyRate"]
        CalcTotal["totalAmount = subtotal + platformFee (₹50.0)"]
        CalcDuration --> CalcHours --> CalcSubtotal --> CalcTotal
    end
    
    CalcUseCase --> BillCalcSubprocess
    CalcTotal --> SaveCompleted[Firestore updates: Status: COMPLETED, loggedHours & bill object]
    
    SaveCompleted --> DisplayInvoice[BookingDetailActivity renders itemized Invoice Card]
    DisplayInvoice --> OfflinePay[Family inspects invoice & performs direct UPI / Cash payment]
    
    OfflinePay --> MarkSettled[Family taps 'Mark Settled']
    MarkSettled --> UpdateSettlement[Firestore updates: settlementStatus: SETTLED]
    
    UpdateSettlement --> ShowReviewDialog[LeaveReviewDialog appears for Family]
    ShowReviewDialog --> SubmitReview[Family rates 1-5 stars & enters feedback comment]
    SubmitReview --> UpdateStats[ReviewRepository writes review & updates caregiver averageRating]
    UpdateStats --> EndSuccess([● Service Lifecycle Successfully Completed])